WEBVTT

00:13:28.917 --> 00:13:30.976
SS: I am thoughtful.
Sekou: I am thoughtful.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.518
SS: I am kind.
Sekou: I am kind.

00:13:32.542 --> 00:13:34.226
SS: I am loving.
Sekou: I am loving.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:35.934
SS: I am caring.
Sekou: I am caring.

00:13:35.958 --> 00:13:37.559
SS: I am funny.
Sekou: I am funny.

00:13:37.583 --> 00:13:39.155
SS: I'm smart.
Sekou: I'm smart.

00:13:39.179 --> 00:13:41.037
SS: I'm a big boy.
Sekou: I'm a big boy.

00:13:41.061 --> 00:13:42.976
SS: I'm a soldier.
Sekou: I'm a soldier.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.934
SS: I'm a warrior.
Sekou: I'm a warrior.

00:13:44.958 --> 00:13:46.559
SS: I am Sekou.
Sekou: I am Sekou.

00:13:46.583 --> 00:13:52.643
(Cheers and applause)

00:13:52.667 --> 00:13:53.917
ER: Good job, baby.